Khara sends fourteen rakshasas first. Then he comes himself, with fourteen thousand.
RAMA: Take Sita to the cave in the hill, Lakshmana, and stand at its mouth. Do not come out, whatever you hear.
LAKSHMANA: You mean to meet them alone.
RAMA: I mean to be sure of her. Go.
